      "font size" : 12.0,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.502]",
      "content" : "    (1) No person shall be deprived of his or her life intentionally save in execution of the sentence of a court in respect of an offence under the law in force in Botswana of which he or she has been convicted.",
